    "content": "66266ba0a7ce2235b8e9143c5d155206780d22bd Adapt temporal filter strength\nBUG=b/410661330\n\nChange-Id: I24f4ae8697f28f788faaed6442e697ae7d53df6e\n\nd45fcc1e79f7908c316b89982aa42185e5bbac93 fix doxygen '\\brief' syntax\nAdds missing '\\'.\n\nChange-Id: I162950b092324344586648ac101dd61a1283e380\n\n--\n\n6eaf4e1a8b42a42fd8ac5e18b05bd9f52b71f3da Limit transform block search speed feature\nBUG=b/410661330\n\nChange-Id: Ia3acc8b956ec6f6c38a895135578e897b04253da\n\n378f15d1cbd5102f89a52881bcdcf2c010f3c5c8 svc_encoder_rtc: support adding local metadata\nBug: 377851082\nChange-Id: I85bab17caf126a0beb75f7cd694143f6da925ba6\n\na1f78554be373dcb47fb2b9a61372965f7536d74 Add avx512 detection & add sad highway avx512\n--\nMaintain better temporal consistency for improved visual quality.\n\nBUG=b/410661330\n\nChange-Id: I01c41669e4be35584316be034d418dc195ccd6c6\n\n8b59cadd068275fcdac5bfbff9575238437d94ca Further adjustment to improve temporal consistency\nBUG=b/410661330\n\nChange-Id: Ieccd0b0b2fe73e768cf3246969ee424bb435f627\n\n719f60edc51b6141a2434bf1b5110c2fb075b246 Silence Coverity warning\nConvert num_planes into an input argument to silence the Coverity\nwarning:\nCID 520721: Control flow issues (DEADCODE)\n\n--\nMake the quality more consistent through the motion compensation.\n\nBUG=b/410661330\n\nChange-Id: I92e8de1fb1844ec0e3de32c482fa118d5ecbbbd8\n\n1983dea2323c761a09555791a81421a24d73cfe1 lc-dec: Set min/max_lr_unit_size to 128\nThis patch limits the min and max loop restoration unit size\nto 128 (i.e. half of RESTORATION_UNITSIZE_MAX) for frame\nresolution\n   • between 480 and 720 for speed <= 3\n--\nmotion constraint.\n\nBUG=b/369204758\n\nChange-Id: I6386acd423116d817124bd197f0def00aa4960db\n\n76621e2cfc8cf4ba4027946a59be91384ca5e7ae highway: Add hwy to install list\nChange-Id: I242f1e17c1344a6882aa9a14a24eb8f2f6a21a8d\n\n9574bae458f90f974f954c4ecad823fe24407c77 Revert \"highway: Target SIMD appropriately\"\nThis reverts commit aa16ccd6b09eac065654f59